      Paradox Client is a high-performance modular Minecraft client and launcher designed for modern Minecraft gameplay.
    </p>
    <p>Features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Built-in custom rendering pipeline and distance-field font rendering.</li>
      <li>Integrated Axiom bootstrap and Marrow loader.</li>
      <li>Automatic Java runtime setup and asset management.</li>
      <li>Discord Rich Presence integration.</li>
      <li>Clean and responsive user interface.</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
